            "detailed_description": "Tired of the simplest platformers? I came to break your keyboards and check your nerves! It's not just &quot;another game,&quot; it's a challenge, and I'm throwing it to you!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 50 challenging levels</li></ul>Each movement will have to be perfected, before the level can be completed.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Complicated management</li></ul>The usual control scheme is complicated by the presence of inertia and the physical size of the character. You will have to calculate each subsequent action.<br>Cards and online table of records in the next updates.",
